  "text": "Praetor neutralized. Battlements clear. The summit flak arrays have fallen silent. Heavy armor, weak servos. Now those blast doors look less welcoming. Think they heard what happened to their guardian. Pressure falling, temperature rising. That storm around the summit is getting tighter. This is not normal weather. It is a power siphon. He is drawing energy straight into the throne room. My shields can feel the distortion. The dissonance behind those doors is deafening. He knows we are here. He has stopped hiding. Gate relays unlocked. The Praetor key was the last barrier. Releasing the hydraulic bolts. Three, two, one. Blast doors opening. Throne chamber confirmed. Lethal energy readings beyond the threshold. Proceed together. From the flooded ruins to the clouds. All this way, all these people depending on us. We finish it here. We set out to free this city. We finish together. Axiom force, draw steel. Behind these doors is judgment day.",
